        "status": "unmet",
        "evidence": "There is only one drawer, drawer:0#0,0#cut. A half base has one cut face, so it takes one drawer. A full or quarter base takes none. With the drawer fitted, the configurator offers no further drawer spots."
      },
      {
        "id": "R3",
